<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-01to2022-12-31" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfAccruedLiabilitiesTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_89A_eus-gaap--ScheduleOfAccruedLiabilitiesTableTextBlock_zJrP6IG5L3T8" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 2022 and 2021, accrued liabilities consisted of the following:</span></p>

